--- INSTANCEOF Matrix Tester ---
--- Built-in type signatures ---
PASS: int
PASS: float
PASS: NULL
PASS: string
PASS: list
PASS: dict
PASS: user function
PASS: anonymous function
PASS: built-in function
PASS: bound method
PASS: enum member
PASS: enum
PASS: class instance
--- Values are never instances of an unrelated class ---
PASS: 5 INSTANCEOF A is false
PASS: string INSTANCEOF A is false
PASS: list INSTANCEOF A is false
PASS: dict INSTANCEOF A is false
PASS: function INSTANCEOF A is false
PASS: enum member INSTANCEOF A is false
PASS: enum INSTANCEOF A is false
--- Class instances and inheritance ---
PASS: instance of own class
PASS: instance of unrelated class
PASS: subclass instance of parent
PASS: subclass instance of itself
PASS: parent instance of subclass
PASS: class A INSTANCEOF Object
PASS: class A INSTANCEOF A is false
--- Right operand must be a Class or Type ---
PASS: 5 INSTANCEOF 3 -> Right operand of INSTANCEOF must be a Class or Type
PASS: string INSTANCEOF string -> Right operand of INSTANCEOF must be a Class or Type
PASS: list INSTANCEOF list -> Right operand of INSTANCEOF must be a Class or Type
PASS: dict INSTANCEOF dict -> Right operand of INSTANCEOF must be a Class or Type
PASS: function INSTANCEOF number -> Right operand of INSTANCEOF must be a Class or Type
PASS: built-in INSTANCEOF number -> Right operand of INSTANCEOF must be a Class or Type
PASS: enum member INSTANCEOF number -> Right operand of INSTANCEOF must be a Class or Type
PASS: enum INSTANCEOF number -> Right operand of INSTANCEOF must be a Class or Type
PASS: instance INSTANCEOF number -> Right operand of INSTANCEOF must be a Class or Type
